{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abby Normalli in Mayhem Mansion</strong> is a jazz-soaked 3D platformer bursting with razzmatazz, mischief, and cartoon calamity. Step into the shoes of a firecracker, with a flair for trouble and a hammer that hits harder than a speakeasy bouncer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One dame. One hammer. One screwy inheritance.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re <strong>Abby Normalli</strong>, a swell gal with a love for hot tunes, heavy hitters, and poking her nose where it don\u2019t belong. When your off-the-rails great-uncle kicks the bucket, he doesn\u2019t leave a will, he leaves a scavenger hunt! Dig up the most family heirlooms stashed around his ritzy, trap-laden estate, and the whole inheritance is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But keep your peepers peeled, your kooky kin are chasing the same prize, and they ain\u2019t above playing dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/8065312ea3828583c8343c959445ce3c.poster.avif?t=1773268713\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/8065312ea3828583c8343c959445ce3c.webm?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/8065312ea3828583c8343c959445ce3c.mp4?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big maps. Bigger moxie.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the mansion is a new slice of nonsense, from haunted hideaways and busted labs to garden parties gone goofy. You\u2019ll be solving puzzles, hopping platforms, dodging traps, and cracking wise the whole way through.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing big</strong> with Abby\u2019s oversized hammer, perfect for smashing, bashing, and making an entrance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam wild</strong> through nonlinear 3D worlds packed with secrets, gags, and zany surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put the squeeze</strong> on rival relatives as you work your way through a family tree full of nuts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snag heirlooms</strong> to climb the inheritance ladder and prove you\u2019ve got the goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/004d630609c2c0355a8117756806c7c4.poster.avif?t=1773268713\" width=400 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/004d630609c2c0355a8117756806c7c4.webm?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/004d630609c2c0355a8117756806c7c4.mp4?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Family Feud, Full Swing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kooky kin aren\u2019t just lurking in the shadows, they\u2019re standing in your way, each with a flair for the dramatic and a taste for trouble. From daredevils and mad scientists to mob bosses and mystical debutantes, every family showdown is a slapstick spectacle packed with clever tricks, wild attacks, and plenty of chaos. Outsmart, outmaneuver, and out-hammer them to claim the heirlooms, and show the Normalli name who\u2019s really in charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/49d9193d1fa70bc998d37496fd1690c1.poster.avif?t=1773268713\" width=400 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/49d9193d1fa70bc998d37496fd1690c1.webm?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/extras/49d9193d1fa70bc998d37496fd1690c1.mp4?t=1773268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover Artwork by\u00a0Marisela Cerda</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812530?t=1773268713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812530?t=1773268713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/28c557cc0619b9c14da03e952758ca67d8c89323/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773268713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/28c557cc0619b9c14da03e952758ca67d8c89323/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773268713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abby Normalli in Mayhem Mansion</strong> is a jazz-soaked 3D platformer bursting with razzmatazz, mischief, and cartoon calamity. Step into the shoes of a firecracker, with a flair for trouble and a hammer that hits harder than a speakeasy bouncer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One dame. One hammer. One screwy inheritance.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re <strong>Abby Normalli</strong>, a swell gal with a love for hot tunes, heavy hitters, and poking her nose where it don\u2019t belong. When your off-the-rails great-uncle kicks the bucket, he doesn\u2019t leave a will, he leaves a scavenger hunt! Dig up the most family heirloom