ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/ff4b94813ca3a9558a2251cf78703e759b972f7b/ss_ff4b94813ca3a9558a2251cf78703e759b972f7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773268713","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/ff4b94813ca3a9558a2251cf78703e759b972f7b/ss_ff4b94813ca3a9558a2251cf78703e759b972f7b.600x338.jpg?t=1773268713"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/73406f93efd958bbf4f1e056f97267b0c1afcf66/ss_73406f93efd958bbf4f1e056f97267b0c1afcf66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773268713","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/73406f93efd958bbf4f1e056f97267b0c1afcf66/ss_73406f93efd958bbf4f1e056f97267b0c1afcf66.600x338.jpg?t=1773268713"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/2182053f418aca28272b089cd36d65930fa7fc57/ss_2182053f418aca28272b089cd36d65930fa7fc57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773268713","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812530/2182053f418aca28272b089cd36d65930fa7fc57/ss_2182053f418aca28272b089cd36d65930fa7fc57.600x338.jpg?t=1773268713"}],"short_description":"A jazz-fueled 3D platformer where you bash, bounce, and explore a sprawling cartoon mansion. Play as Abby Normalli, a mischief-loving whirlwind with a giant hammer, and compete to collect family heirlooms in chaotic, character-packed worlds.","steam_appid":3812530,"support_info":{"email":"support@terrainferna.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}